      "heading": "题目描述",
      "html": "<div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"markdown\"><p>求 <span class=\"katex math inline\">A</span><sup><span class=\"katex math inline\">B</span></sup> 的所有约数之和 <span class=\"katex math inline\">mod</span> <span class=\"katex math inline\">9901</span>。</p>\n</div>            </div>",
      "text": "求 AB 的所有约数之和 mod 9901。"
    },
    {
      "heading": "输入",
      "html": "<div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"markdown\"><p>输入两个整数 <span class=\"katex math inline\">A</span>,<span class=\"katex math inline\">B</span>。</p>\n</div>            </div>",
      "text": "输入两个整数 A,B。"
    },
    {
      "heading": "输出",
      "html": "<div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"markdown\"><p>输出答案  <span class=\"katex math inline\">mod</span> <span class=\"katex math inline\">9901</span>。</p>\n</div>            </div>",
      "text": "输出答案  mod 9901。"
    },
    {
      "heading": "样例",
      "html": "<div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"sample-test\">\n                        <div class=\"input\">\n                            <h4>输入</h4>\n                            <pre>2 3</pre>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"output\">\n                            <h4>输出</h4>\n                            <pre>15</pre>\n                        </div>\n\n                        \n                                            </div>\n                </div>",
      "text": "输入\n                            2 3\n                        \n                        \n                            输出\n                            15"
    },
    {
      "heading": "说明",
      "html": "<div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"markdown\"><p><strong>样例说明</strong>  </p>\n<p><span class=\"katex math inline\">2^3=8</span>，<span class=\"katex math inline\">8</span> 的所有约数为 <span class=\"katex math inline\">1</span>,<span class=\"katex math inline\">2</span>,<span class=\"katex math inline\">4</span>,<span class=\"katex math inline\">8</span>，<span class=\"katex math inline\">1+2+4+8=15</span>,<span class=\"katex math inline\">15</span> <span class=\"katex math inline\">mod</span> <span class=\"katex math inline\">9901</span>=<span class=\"katex math inline\">15</span>，因此输出 <span class=\"katex math inline\">15</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>数据范围与提示</strong>  </p>\n<p>对于全部数据，<span class=\"katex math inline\">0≤A,B≤5 \\times 10^7</span>。</p>\n</div>\n\n                    \n                </div>",
      "text": "样例说明  \n2^3=8，8 的所有约数为 1,2,4,8，1+2+4+8=15,15 mod 9901=15，因此输出 15。\n数据范围与提示  \n对于全部数据，0≤A,B≤5 \\times 10^7。"
    },
